---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<MainLayout
title="About CreatorStack | Honest AI Software Reviews"
description="Learn about CreatorStack, our mission, how we test AI tools, and how we keep our reviews transparent and independent."
canonical="https://creatorstack2-0.pages.dev/about"
>

<!-- HERO -->

<section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-purple-700 py-28 text-white">

<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 text-center">

<span class="rounded-full bg-white/20 px-5 py-2 font-semibold">

👋 About CreatorStack

</span>

<h1 class="mt-8 text-6xl font-extrabold">

Helping You Choose the Best AI Tools

</h1>

<p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-4xl text-2xl leading-10 text-blue-100">

CreatorStack is an independent AI software review website dedicated to
helping creators, businesses, students and professionals discover the
best AI tools available today.

</p>

</div>

</section>

<!-- OUR MISSION -->

<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24">

<h2 class="text-5xl font-extrabold">

Our Mission

</h2>

<p class="mt-8 text-xl leading-9 text-gray-700">

Artificial Intelligence is evolving incredibly fast.
Every week dozens of new AI tools are launched, making it difficult to know
which ones are actually worth using.

</p>

<p class="mt-6 text-xl leading-9 text-gray-700">

Our mission is simple:

<strong>Save you time by testing AI software so you don't have to.</strong>

</p>

<p class="mt-6 text-xl leading-9 text-gray-700">

Instead of reading marketing pages filled with promises,
we use each product ourselves and explain:

</p>

<ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-xl">

<li>✅ What the tool does well</li>

<li>✅ Where it falls short</li>

<li>✅ Who should use it</li>

<li>✅ Whether it's worth paying for</li>

<li>✅ Better alternatives when available</li>

</ul>

</section>

<!-- HOW WE REVIEW -->

<section class="bg-gray-50 py-24">

<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">

<div class="text-center">

<h2 class="text-5xl font-extrabold">

How We Review AI Tools

</h2>

<p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl text-xl text-gray-600">

Every review follows the same evaluation process.

</p>

</div>

<div class="mt-20 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">

<div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 shadow">

<div class="text-5xl">⚙️</div>

<h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-bold">

Features

</h3>

<p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">

We test every important feature instead of relying on product descriptions.

</p>

</div>

<div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 shadow">

<div class="text-5xl">🚀</div>

<h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-bold">

Performance

</h3>

<p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">

Speed, reliability and user experience are evaluated in real-world usage.

</p>

</div>

<div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 shadow">

<div class="text-5xl">💰</div>

<h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-bold">

Value

</h3>

<p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">

We compare pricing against competing software to determine overall value.

</p>

</div>

<div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 shadow">

<div class="text-5xl">👨‍💻</div>

<h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-bold">

Ease of Use

</h3>

<p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">

We look at how quickly beginners can become productive.

</p>

</div>

<div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 shadow">

<div class="text-5xl">📞</div>

<h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-bold">

Support

</h3>

<p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">

Documentation, tutorials and customer support all matter.

</p>

</div>

<div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 shadow">

<div class="text-5xl">🏆</div>

<h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-bold">

Overall Rating

</h3>

<p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">

Every score is based on the complete experience, not just one feature.

</p>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- AFFILIATE -->

<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24">

<div class="rounded-3xl border-2 border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 p-12">

<h2 class="text-4xl font-bold">

Affiliate Disclosure

</h2>

<p class="mt-8 text-xl leading-9 text-gray-700">

Some links on CreatorStack are affiliate links.

If you purchase a product through one of these links, we may receive a small commission at no additional cost to you.

</p>

<p class="mt-6 text-xl leading-9 text-gray-700">

Affiliate commissions help us continue testing software,
publishing reviews and keeping CreatorStack free for everyone.

</p>

<p class="mt-6 text-xl leading-9 text-gray-700 font-semibold">

Affiliate partnerships NEVER influence our ratings or recommendations.

</p>

</div>

</section>

<!-- WHY TRUST -->

<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24">

<h2 class="text-5xl font-extrabold">

Why Trust CreatorStack?

</h2>

<div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">

<div class="rounded-3xl border p-8">

<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">

✔ Independent Reviews

</h3>

<p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">

Our opinions are based on real testing and research.

</p>

</div>

<div class="rounded-3xl border p-8">

<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">

✔ Constant Updates

</h3>

<p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">

AI changes rapidly, so we regularly update our reviews.

</p>

</div>

<div class="rounded-3xl border p-8">

<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">

✔ Transparent Ratings

</h3>

<p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">

Every review uses the same scoring methodology.

</p>

</div>

<div class="rounded-3xl border p-8">

<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">

✔ Built for Real Users

</h3>

<p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">

We focus on practical recommendations rather than hype.

</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- CTA -->

<section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-purple-700 py-24 text-white">

<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 text-center">

<h2 class="text-5xl font-extrabold">

Ready to Discover the Best AI Tools?

</h2>

<p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl text-2xl leading-10 text-blue-100">

Explore our expert reviews and find the perfect AI software for your workflow.

</p>

<a
href="/best-ai-tools-2026"
class="mt-10 inline-flex rounded-2xl bg-white px-10 py-5 text-xl font-bold text-blue-700 transition hover:scale-105">

🏆 Explore Best AI Tools

</a>

</div>

</section>

<Footer />

</MainLayout>